@startuml HU10_LibroMayor_secuencia
title HU-10 — Libro mayor y estado de cuenta\nRepository + append-only

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2E75B6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF3FB
skinparam noteBorderColor #F0A500
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1

actor       "Usuario"                          as User
boundary    "Frontend (React)"                 as UI
control     "ledgerController"                 as LC
participant "authMiddleware (protect)"         as MW
participant "LedgerService <<Repository>>"     as LED
database    "PostgreSQL\n(ledger_entries)"     as DB

autonumber

note over LC, LED
  El libro mayor es append-only: solo INSERT. Cada movimiento de dinero
  (DISBURSEMENT, PAYMENT, LIQUIDATION, LOCK, RELEASE) genera 1 asiento con
  su balanceAfter. Productores: Factory (desembolso), PaymentProcessor (pago),
  LiquidationService (liquidación). Aquí se consultan.
end note

== Mis asientos (paginado) ==
User -> UI : Ver libro mayor
UI -> LC : GET /api/ledger?page=1&size=20 (JWT)
LC -> MW : protect
MW --> LC : req.user
LC -> LED : getEntries(req.user.id, page, size)
activate LED
LED -> DB : LedgerEntry.findAndCountAll({ where: userId,\n order: created_at DESC, limit, offset })
note right of DB
  Índice (user_id, created_at)
  acelera la paginación.
end note
DB --> LED : { rows, count }
LED --> LC : { entries, total, page }
deactivate LED
LC --> UI : 200 { entries, pagination }

== Estado de cuenta consolidado ==
UI -> LC : GET /api/ledger/statement (JWT)
LC -> LED : getStatement(req.user.id)
activate LED
LED -> DB : SUM(amount) GROUP BY type  (DISBURSEMENT/PAYMENT/LIQUIDATION)
DB --> LED : totales por tipo
LED -> LED : balance = ultimo balanceAfter
LED --> LC : { totalPrestado, totalPagado, totalLiquidado, saldo }
deactivate LED
LC --> UI : 200 { statement }
UI --> User : Totales por tipo y saldo resultante

note over User, DB
  Append-only: no hay endpoint de UPDATE/DELETE de asientos.
  QA: LedgerService.test.js (asiento por pago, statement agregado,
  inmutabilidad). Escenario de calidad 5 (auditabilidad).
end note

@enduml
